invariant: INV-16
file: handshake_flight.c
catches: tcp_nonblocking_loop_host
reason: the client derives its x25519 share under WIDEMUL_NOT_STATED whatever
  its ch_cfg.cpu states. The share is the same.
  test/tcp_nonblocking_loop_widemul.h counts the client's calls around
  its own and requires a client whose ch_cfg.cpu holds
  CH_CPU_CONSTANT_TIME_MULTIPLY to call no file under its own names.

--- old
    widemul_x25519_base(widemul_answer(&t->cfg), h->pub, h->priv);
--- new
    widemul_x25519_base(WIDEMUL_NOT_STATED, h->pub, h->priv);
